00:08:40.080 --> 00:08:41.160
It's dangerous!

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:42.410
Don't get too close!

00:08:47.640 --> 00:08:49.180
H-Huh?

00:08:53.200 --> 00:08:54.670
Oh dear!

00:08:57.380 --> 00:08:59.930
Haru!

00:09:00.320 --> 00:09:01.430
Stay away, Ai!

00:09:02.840 --> 00:09:08.190
If you don't want Momo to fight that person, then you can't fight her either!

00:09:08.190 --> 00:09:12.070
I don't know what's going on,
but you're both her moms right?

00:09:25.540 --> 00:09:28.040
Dang it, that's weird...

00:09:28.480 --> 00:09:31.790
This was supposed to make me a Best!
Why isn't it working?

00:09:31.790 --> 00:09:33.440
Whatever. I need to stop them!

00:09:33.440 --> 00:09:34.240
